<title>RUSSIA: Russia's Inkombank 1996 net rises to $34.20 mln.</title>
<headline>Russia's Inkombank 1996 net rises to $34.20 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>					1996		  1995</p>
<p>    Net profit		    34.24		 1.86</p>
<p>Total income</p>
<p>    before provisions	  146.26	     339.86</p>
<p>    Net interest income	316.24	     214.19</p>
<p>    Operating expenses	 265.16	     225.22</p>
<p>    Total assets	     2,800.12	   2,611.14</p>
<p>    Capital and reserves     295.22	     203.73</p>
<p>Gross loans to</p>
<p>    customers		  1,296.77	   1,187.82</p>
<p>    Provisions for losses    156.59	     123.53</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name AB Inkombank. Figures in million of dollars to international accounting standards audited by KPMG Moscow.</p>
<p>The bank has issued level-one American Depositary Receipts and plans to issue Eurobonds.</p>
<p>--Julie Tolkacheva, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
